    "body": "Reply to the review of head `e24f6ba`. The review found no code blockers. It asks for one body change:\n\n> 1. The body must end with `Fixes #4405` to close the issue this PR addresses.\n\n`#4405` is this pull request, not an issue. There is no separate issue for this fix. The PR works on the red-main issue #4400, and the body ends with `Refs #4400` for that reason. `Fixes #4400` is not correct: #4400 also tracks the slow catalog tests and the runner clippy fault, and it closes itself on the next green run. So the body stays as it is. Ready for a re-check.\n",
